    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Inner Circle Task Force",
    "summary": "During your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), you may choose 1 **objective**; it stays your [vowed objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives) up to the start of your following [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase). Friendly **DEATHWING INFANTRY** units get +1 to **[wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)** for attacks against enemy units in range of the **vowed objective**.\n\n**Restrictions:** no **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units from another Chapter; **DARK ANGELS** units are allowed.",
